<title>USA: Wynn's names new chairman.</title>
<headline>Wynn's names new chairman.</headline>
<dateline>ORANGE, Calif 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wynn's International Inc said James Carroll, president and chief executive, will become chairman and chief executive.</p>
<p>Wesley Bellwood, formerly chairman, was appointed chairman emeritus.</p>
<p>John Huber was named president and chief operating officer. James Barlow, presently controller, was named treasurer. All changes are effective immediately.</p>
<p>Wynn's also announced a three-for-two stock split to be effected by distribution of one additional share of the common stock for every two shares currently outstanding.</p>
</text>
